<title>ITALY: Gross yield 7.20 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</title>
<headline>Gross yield 7.20 pct on 3-month Italian T-bills.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-03-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for the sale of 33.5 trillion lire of three, six and 12-month short-term Treasury bills (BOTs).</p>
<p>		 Gross yield  (last)    Avge price   (last)</p>
<p>    3-month     7.20	(5.99)    98.18	  (98.48)</p>
<p>    6-month     7.39	(6.35)    96.37	  (96.88)</p>
<p>    1-year	7.41	(6.86)    93.05	  (93.55)</p>
<p>Note: results compared with a previous auction on March 14.</p>
</text>
